# An example repository allowlist. The broker may mint a task token only for a
# repository named here, one per line. Copy it and pass your own with
# --repos-allow; the embedded copy is only a fallback.
#
# The App installation is the hard limit: a token for a repo outside it is refused
# by GitHub. This file is the policy on top, so a task cannot ask for a different
# project than the one it is working on. Add a line when you start a new project,
# and install the App on that repo too.

crew-broker
